{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "8ee0674327b6f2d6359242012f40d7b65c8c23f34323172d6ce0963048f180b2", "ja": "あこがれのアイドル", "zh": "憧憬的偶像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2ed598c6a836170ee4fd163c038fe24b1988477bb480aecc524625f9b0a625bf", "ja": "コーラスに参加する合唱団の子ども達との\r\n顔合わせが行われる。しかし本物のアイドル\r\nを前に、子ども達は緊張気味。そこで千鶴\r\nは、子ども達と仲良くなるためにクリスマス\r\nパーティーを開くのはどうかと提案する。", "zh": "将与参加合唱的合唱团孩子们进行见面会。然而，面对真正的偶像，孩子们显得有些紧张。于是千鹤提议，为了和孩子们亲近一些，不如举办一场圣诞派对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3780b10dc01e48ccd91c551c01d4a283c91bcea50a5ca5e57e49682394af2661", "ja": "（新曲にコーラス参加してくれる合唱団が決まった。\n今日は、アイドル達との顔合わせだ）", "zh": "（参加新歌合唱的合唱团已经确定了。今天要和偶像们见面。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "aed4b9f0166d1d67e52f62764cfcb6c9d0bf864692746a19508316eb45d68df0", "ja": "今日は合唱団のみんなに来てもらった。\nまずは一人一人、自己紹介してみようか！", "zh": "今天请合唱团的大家过来了。\n首先，大家一个个来做自我介绍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "604d8f2b50091a270ccb1ebcb99a750067e971f1f211b4bd2d67af1dedf68b87", "ja": "はい！　……はじめまして！　ボクの名前は菊地真。\n真お姉さんって呼んでね。よろしく！", "zh": "好的！……初次见面！我的名字叫菊地真。\n叫我真姐姐吧。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1003_otokonoko1", "source_sha256": "b8cfa139a4dfd11594b288f03f25055e774b3054ab29eb470fe55992e3615e63", "ja": "よ、よろしく、おねがいします……。", "zh": "请、请多、关照……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "be22300a5c0c5888df7771f6685c5365d6d4d48af828753ea28f26eaf69bccf7", "ja": "あれ、元気がないね。\n緊張してるのかな……？", "zh": "哎呀，没什么精神呢。\n是在紧张吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "cdc47615f43053eba07dee8fb692b840c7adf11dfc79d97e2786b1da186fa905", "ja": "そのようですわね。\nこういう時は、優しく話しかけるのが一番ですわ。", "zh": "看来确实是这样呢。\n这种时候，温柔地和对方说说话是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "10779487088f09046e9b0ffc90742d2c57016f403980433b233ef8201c12546f", "ja": "こんにちは。わたくしは、二階堂千鶴と申します。\n緊張しなくても、大丈夫ですからね。", "zh": "你好，我是二阶堂千鹤。  \n不用紧张，没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1007_onnanoko1", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "5108a60a5ef2dd896f62184de8d6b760bc62fd656a01a72f22d7674ef4e78a03", "ja": "はじめまして。真壁瑞希お姉さん、だぞ。\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "初次见面。我是姐姐真壁瑞希哦。\n请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "c6a16485732ea375d60ae0d5bfcbb0231476439a7a19c5e1c1100f97316b7685", "ja": "島原エレナお姉さんだヨ～！\nみんな、これからいーっぱい、仲良くしようネ！", "zh": "我是岛原艾琳娜大姐姐唷～！\n大家，今后要好好～相处哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1010_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "d45f5dd2466ec9f5d77b5225b98b85d08f6a1152c6262e7f24d188d4d56445ef", "ja": "よ……よろしくおねがいしますっ！", "zh": "请……请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "57186cc4a90b2fcc4b2c9674a373bdb08f2142a32d99ed180cc02b227b7e0f39", "ja": "おっ、君はすっごく元気がいいね！\n他のみんなも、一緒に楽しく歌おう！", "zh": "哦，你看起来精神十足啊！\n大家也一起来开心地唱歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "91e731a53d9d35cb8a052da924a01a7c58643cf94e420f6db0a8e48d9590c8cf", "ja": "何かわからないことがあったら、\nいつでも、わたくしたちに聞いてくださいましね？", "zh": "如果有任何不明白的地方，请随时来问我们哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1014_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "762d42f512a0128d32482209dcf3dab149256627d3005899892ac39a33d3018a", "ja": "そ、それじゃあ……はい！\nあの、真お姉ちゃんに質問です！", "zh": "那、那就……好！\n那个，我有问题要问真姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "061b40b616352cf4b4ece0cc80002f54d725e036415c7b6c9a26300c8f055f09", "ja": "君は、さっき元気よく挨拶してくれた子だね！\n何かな？", "zh": "你是刚才很有精神地跟我打招呼的小朋友呢！\n想问什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1016_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "6a588872320d1501c6f107c6621ed67b8ff7bde5665b47b872fa278f40469495", "ja": "あの……どうしたら、真お姉ちゃんみたいに\n歌が上手になれますか？　いっぱい練習すればいいの？", "zh": "那个……要怎样才能像真姐姐一样唱歌唱得好呢？只要多加练习就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "79c77ccfdf7c4236f9ce4b85bed8b9b83ebcf435da64a22efabbb4de0a3350c1", "ja": "えっ、ボクみたいに！？", "zh": "诶，像我这样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1018_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "fbb7313385b84bbded9f883fd4200bdb285fe73686e3a8b604811575dde1523d", "ja": "うん。私じゃ、ムリかな……。", "zh": "嗯。凭我，还是不行吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "cefc81f249f8e0532bad7bf08d7e11ab170fe085fa510693bba3f65f1ef0ba3a", "ja": "ううん、そんなことないよ！\nボクも今まで、たくさん練習してきたんだよ！", "zh": "不是的，才不是那样！\n我之前也练习了很多很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "3404864a56b7e256f877207895bde058513785d8d836f752ce254b7d0d9ba557", "ja": "そのおかげで、歌もダンスもできるようになったんだ。\nだから、君も絶対上手になるよ。一緒に頑張ろうね！", "zh": "多亏了那些练习，我才能学会唱歌和跳舞。\n所以，你也一定能变得擅长的。我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1021_onnanoko2", "source_sha256": "a9c56f82f2c31d2e8b975ac8ebc181b3df5344b7ce77ba0d692ae945ef569555", "ja": "……うんっ！\nわかった、がんばる！", "zh": "……嗯！\n知道了，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a85dcba7eb7b46e50900137969e27e71ed84594d1f96c0339871353a41ea7688", "ja": "（コーラスの子ども達との顔合わせが終わった。皆と\n打ち解けるまで、もう少し時間がかかりそうだな……）", "zh": "（和合唱的孩子们见面结束了。看来，在和大家熟悉起来之前，还需要再花一点时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8fec8db3720ed3b6df4c6b580acc826732091b69b64cce7e7a8895f59938a65a", "ja": "（歌であたたかい気持ちになってもらうためにも、\n皆で楽しく歌ってほしい。何かいい方法は……）", "zh": "（为了让大家感受到歌声带来的温暖，也希望大家能一起开心地歌唱。有没有什么好办法呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "f29cb74386a0dc2f867f691de62393f9cd47ad44270c33d155187cf358754cce", "ja": "なんか、みんな表情が硬かったね。ボクがしゃべると、\n一段と強張ってた気がする……。ボク、怖いのかなぁ。", "zh": "总觉得，大家的表情都很僵硬呢。我一开口说话，好像就变得更加紧张了……我是不是很吓人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "74c482545f4636570c498f52eee51cdf30d50e48d3ca2cc33eb734b6c24f4ed4", "ja": "それはきっと、真が有名なアイドルだから、\n緊張していただけですわ。心配いりませんわよ。", "zh": "那一定是因为真是位知名偶像，大家只是紧张而已。您不用担心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "bc96fbd5f55014dd4b482a8a5d998646e2d617d10eaec764caf335b02adfde9b", "ja": "そうですね。けど……もうすこし、\nみなさんの緊張をほぐしてあげたいです。", "zh": "是啊。不过……我想再帮大家放松一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "9386a95aa1d5df70211a427f236dfe17729a71d85b28b843dcabedf872b99809", "ja": "そうだネ……。せっかく一緒のステージに立つんだし、\nみんなにも、楽しんで歌ってほしいナ。", "zh": "是呀……难得要一起站上舞台，\n我也希望大家都能开心地唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "3fdeb3ba63c21c30346c6165360d64009f91853ccbb5e45683482fa2bc9a39ae", "ja": "うん。せめてレコーディングまでに、\nもっとリラックスしてもらえるようになりたいよね。", "zh": "嗯。至少在录音前，\n希望能让大家更加放松就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "c1dad654b6b98395be8c03681471eb5c631bf0a9c34383ef53fc04d08e814370", "ja": "まだ、時間はありますが……どうすれば。\n……難題だぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "还有时间，但是……该怎么做呢。\n……这可是个难题啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "59940ffe501ea0a77871f01f42800bb61596f9f1f45e893ce99596236a84ab23", "ja": "……あっ！\nわたくし、良いことを思いつきましたわ。", "zh": "……啊！\n我想到了一个好主意哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "0c8a330383a4b52f8764995ff6698a1c2bdcfb0f31dfa16215ddbe13be6d54de", "ja": "良いこと……？", "zh": "好事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "b3aa9dd2597bcc653fb7670c5e3f0050ac270fe1f5d3035ccded03f62f4389ac", "ja": "ええ。コーラスの皆と仲良くなるために、\n交流会を開くというのはどうかしら？", "zh": "嗯。为了和合唱团的大家搞好关系，举办一场交流会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "1e325887f6d66322cf773cfaadbbe87d41e56c0d449b65c24d268d3fa5aec230", "ja": "簡単に言うと、\nすこし早いクリスマスパーティーですわ♪", "zh": "简而言之，就是一场稍微提前的圣诞派对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "01b4c70d8772a1584b74b7e3f15786982a9e01226bd711ab4d6debf142cf3761", "ja": "おお……なんと。素晴らしいアイディアです。\n親睦を深めるのに、パーティーは最適だと思います。", "zh": "哦……竟然如此。真是个绝妙的主意。\n我认为，要加深彼此的感情，没有比派对更合适的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "900613d990c7d024a641ee15b9b7e72db0e1f51dc988bf1a79f3447e4c79914c", "ja": "うんうん！　みんなでおいしいものを食べたり、\n踊ったりすれば、すぐに仲良くなれるヨ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！大家一起吃好吃的、跳跳舞，很快就能成为好朋友啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "6ed507f6c2fae005b186bc8e002168d6c7f268b73e22d720368a79a19cae5c20", "ja": "先日、エレナが大勢でクリスマスパーティーをする\n話をしていたでしょう？　それで思いついたんですの。", "zh": "前几天，艾莲娜不是说过要和大家一起举办圣诞派对吗？我就是由此想到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "10ababc99662a97bbb800c6309b1eafa45063fa05d69cb3dcf58a9c91d136a61", "ja": "そうなノ？\nなんだかうれしいナ、エヘヘ♪", "zh": "是这样吗？\n感觉有点开心呢，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "1cdaa79b6e9b9fa05b823d31777c3d5eb8c97331ac22f578c14c99451101d96f", "ja": "それじゃあ、{$P$}にも相談して、\nクリスマスパーティーの計画を立てよう！", "zh": "那么，就去和{$P$}商量一下，制定圣诞派对的计划吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "0c78ec674b63efd8fe9af826a9505882f117c61717d81e04c3b79ad0b936de53", "ja": "はい。パーティーに向けて、私は新しいマジックを\n覚えようかと。……がんばるぞ。", "zh": "好的。为了派对，我打算学一个新的魔术……我要加油了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "1cfeadd497adaf00cd77573919a57427bfa0b1288c6837534eeaeee807ac14cf", "ja": "それじゃあワタシは、音楽を用意しようかナ？\nみんなで踊れるようにネっ♪", "zh": "那我来准备音乐吧？\n这样大家就能一起跳舞了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1042_038chz", "source_sha256": "2892a0c2c68d63c0082a6c9fcdfeacede76b1a37c044e0506a9bdebe65b10ee7", "ja": "お料理やケーキはもちろん、出し物にダンス……\nでしたら、会場は広い方がいいですわね。", "zh": "料理和蛋糕自不必说，还有节目和舞蹈……\n既然如此，场地还是宽敞些比较好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1043_038chz", "source_sha256": "e3196c3c573399151163c2ffc2c45cddd3b203ce16b99645c7ceeafbfed93f9d", "ja": "レッスンルームを使ってもいいか、わたくしから\n{$P$}に聞いてみますわ！", "zh": "我来问问{$P$}先生，能不能使用练习室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0214_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0214_story_02_1044_006mak", "source_sha256": "40525e576ef9945a51a65bc49062d7b6ea64051c2b98a02d6c6fda3297c28746", "ja": "へへっ、なんかワクワクしてきたね！\nみんなで楽しいパーティーにしよう！", "zh": "嘿嘿，有点兴奋起来了呢！\n大家一起办个开心的派对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
